OL,3,GNEWSASir Patrick Stewart remembered as
OL,4,A'Mirfield's finest'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Patrick Stewart once said he had to
OL,7,Fdrop his Yorkshire accent for
OL,8,FHollywood, but he never forgot his
OL,9,Froots.
OL,11,FThe Mirfield-born actor, best known for
OL,12,Fhis roles in Star Trek and the X-Men
OL,13,Ffilms, died at the age of 86 at his
OL,14,Fhome in Los Angeles on Wednesday after
OL,15,Fsuffering with Alzheimer's Disease and
OL,16,FLewy Body Dementia.
OL,18,FHis death has prompted an outpouring of
OL,19,Flove from the community he proudly
OL,20,Fcalled home, along with his beloved
OL,21,FHuddersfield Town - the club he
OL,22,Ffollowed from childhood.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
