OL,3,GNEWSASir Patrick Stewart remembered as
OL,4,A'Mirfield's finest'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStewart's friend and fellow legendary
OL,7,Factor Sir Ian McKellen said Stewart
OL,8,F"never forsook his origins".
